<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Stone Container raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Stone Container raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- PaineWebber analyst Rich Schneider has raised his rating for Stone Container Corp to attractive from neutral.</p>
<p>-- Shares in the Chicago-based company closed Thursday at 11-7/8.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk (212) 859-1730))</p>
</text>
